WEBVTT

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:02.681
Everything you're about to hear was

00:00:02.681 --> 00:00:04.681
generated from the prompts shown,

00:00:04.681 --> 00:00:06.560
with no edits or modifications.

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:09.903
Just Eleven v4. A speech model that

00:00:09.903 --> 00:00:12.960
doesn't just speak, it performs.

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:16.046
Just give me a moment. Quiet on set!

00:00:16.046 --> 00:00:18.560
Hang on, I can't reach the back to...

00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:21.879
Okay, I'm ready. Rolling! And action!

00:00:21.879 --> 00:00:24.480
I told myself I wouldn't cry.

00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:28.269
You know, I stood... I stood in front

00:00:28.269 --> 00:00:32.160
of the mirror this morning and I said,

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:38.080
not today. And yet... here we are.

00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:39.700
And cut! Splendid!

00:00:39.700 --> 00:00:43.120
Thank you everybody! Great work today!

00:00:43.120 --> 00:00:45.995
One take and you're already being generous?

00:00:45.995 --> 00:00:48.000
Splendid! Thank you everybody!

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:48.902
Who are you and what have

00:00:48.902 --> 00:00:49.840
you done with my director?

00:00:49.840 --> 00:00:51.040
Don't test me!
